<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="Privacy practices for Jennysloth."><header class="page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow">Site Information</p><h1>Privacy</h1><p class="lede">A short explanation of how this website handles analytics, photographs, and protected material.</p></header><section class="section section-soft"><article class="shell narrow prose"><h2>Public site</h2><p>This website uses privacy-friendly, cookie-free basic analytics. It does not use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies, and protected areas are excluded from public analytics.</p><h2>Photographs</h2><p>GPS coordinates and unnecessary EXIF metadata are removed before photographs are published. Public albums show only approximate locations.</p><h2>Protected content</h2><p>Private albums and application materials require authentication. Necessary sessions expire automatically. Protected images and documents are not included in public search, RSS feeds, or sitemaps.</p><h2>Administrator access</h2><p>The administrator email address is used only to deliver one-time sign-in verification codes.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>To request a correction or removal of personal information or a photograph, email <a href="mailto:linchenling233@gmail.com">linchenling233@gmail.com</a>.</p></article></section></BaseLayout>
